# Language statistics should describe what is written here.
#
# `.yidam/.vendor/` is not. It is the yidam template layer — prelude, CLI, SDKs, test harness —
# copied in by `yidam overlay` and replaced wholesale the next time overlay runs. It is tracked
# so a clone is self-contained, not because it is authored in this repository. Left unmarked it
# dominates the language breakdown with Rust, TypeScript, and Python that nobody here wrote.
.yidam/.vendor/** linguist-vendored=true
